  "title": "Course Survey",
  "content": {
    "bibrefs": [],
    "model": [
      {
        "children": [
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Before you begin your journey through "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "text": "REAL CHEM II"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", we would like to get to know you a bit. We know that everyone comes to chemistry with different backgrounds, goals, and feelings toward chemistry. We want this course to be for everyone as much as possible."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2295701712",
                "type": "p"
              },
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "This survey will ask you questions about yourself and how you feel about chemistry. There are no right or wrong answers—you can be completely yourself and honest.  "
                  },
                  {
                    "em": true,
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "Your instructor will have access to this information"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", and we encourage them to use it to support you in this course. You also have the option to opt out of answering any question. Thank you for taking the time!"
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1957808515",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "2775171577",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "People have very different attitudes toward chemistry, which can range from very positive to very critical. The next few questions ask about your opinions about chemistry at this moment in time. We understand they might change later. Importantly, we are interested in your feelings toward "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "chemistry topics and content"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": " separate from other issues like teaching. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1523426417",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "31661047",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 80195,
            "children": [],
            "id": "1944126259",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 78764,
            "children": [],
            "id": "3362713200",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 78939,
            "children": [],
            "id": "3224711560",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Teachers and instructors are often an important component of learning about chemistry. The next few questions ask about your attitudes toward "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "your previous chemistry teachers and their teaching"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". These questions are not about any specific teacher—please think of your "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "overall past experiences"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ". "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "2886016089",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "3638163300",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 79101,
            "children": [],
            "id": "689924215",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 80217,
            "children": [],
            "id": "2314130669",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "Students have various reasons for taking chemistry and different benefits that they hope to gain from learning about this topic. The next few questions ask about some of the things that you may hope to get out of this course."
                  }
                ],
                "id": "929368222",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "3428233719",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
            "activity_id": 79136,
            "children": [],
            "id": "3492712499",
            "type": "activity-reference"
          },
          {
            "children": [
              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "These next few questions ask about your plans, goals, and aspirations regarding your education and professional journey. "
                  }
                ],
                "id": "1493634945",
                "type": "p"
              }
            ],
            "editor": "slate",
            "id": "3193392589",
            "textDirection": "ltr",
            "type": "content"
          },
          {
