              {
                "children": [
                  {
                    "text": "This final set of questions asks about "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "your personal experiences in previous chemistry courses"
                  },
                  {
                    "text": ", including "
                  },
                  {
                    "strong": true,
                    "text": "your feelings "
                  },
                  {
                    "text": "about yourself, your skills, your instructors, and your peers. Remember that there are no right or wrong answers—you can be completely yourself and honest. "
                  }
                ],
